  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[(5 (1)/(4) div 3 (1)/(2) times (5)/(12))-(3)/(16)] div(3 (4)/(7) div (5)/(14)right. {of} ~left.6 (2)/(3)) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[(5 (1)/(4) div 3 (1)/(2) times (5)/(12))-(3)/(16)] div(3 (4)/(7) div (5)/(14)right. {of} ~left.6 (2)/(3)) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n⇒ [((21)/(4) div (7)/(2) times (5)/(12))-(3)/(16)] div((25)/(7) div (5)/(14)right. {of} ~left.(20)/(3)) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n⇒ [((21)/(4) times (2)/(7) times (5)/(12))-(3)/(16)] div((25)/(7) div (50)/(21)) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n⇒ [(5)/(8)-(3)/(16)] div((25)/(7) times (21)/(50)) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n⇒ [(10 - 3)/(16)] div (3)/(2) of 1(1)/(3)\n\n⇒ (7)/(16) div (3)/(2) of (4)/(3)\n\n⇒ (7)/(16) div 2\n\n⇒ (7)/(32)\n\n**∴ Required answer is (7)/(32).**",
